<description>&lt;p&gt;Malian forces rescued 24 soldiers near Kidal while Russia deployed ZALA Lancet suicide drones in Mali, intensifying air and drone strikes. Burkina Faso's military junta is hunting dissidents abroad and targeting journalists, activists and opposition exiles. Islamist militants killed at least 14 Christians in Plateau State, Nigeria. The UN warned that Sahel countries are the most vulnerable to terrorist threat. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOMkdOUkUxZjJrdEJpaEk2bkZuQUxtSklMZDg5bVNJc2xJNjBKQng1NU96RjJCRkV4WkJzekJra2dHTDNxTVh3WTJsMThzOWtlUC0yY0hHb2dYX2xhbXVKZm02QUNGd1VRQzRVTHh5UUNXRk1XYjllN0RfNHpUbGtwMnF2cHZqcEVValZNc1NvbC1QTTBfY1RIb3VYT1JPMlpucGJMV1RvOGlTc00?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE8yeGdBMXZQeHdkUUZ0UGlvRVM2LWtzTXpNaGVPT0JuYW1FWVZXUVZxall0S2hkcG1makZxUHp2aS1SNXNET0s2T3FTVXZFX2hoc1B2ZHVCMHlrRVc5THfSAWNBVV95cUxQbXZTdmkzWXpxci1iTDhkV3I1ZFVSNEtwM0pSbVMyRWxNUVlxM1RkSHRkRzZRWWtuNnU3RFVXenhmamtxNlZRX2VrYjVhX1F5SVNOWU5kVWg3bHFNeWF0TmxIQ0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNVG9JamhJYmxmOE1KOHhZdWlZTDlIRDB1Y0tOeXlIclRCWDlQZGFkTkdGaFc5bVZvQWF5OUVVX1BsUmNWMjdKMFhUeUdnREU0dHFMZ2xFTWZHbEZnZTN6YTFiNGFvV0FSOVNDa3Q0VmJBSEZ3dDk2NDZqdFpXX3hrRFBhSXhWeUthNW1pXzBjTy1Sc1JfWUlNeGdCMHQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPZko1akprNTN0NnZnd09mXzlQbGttQnRobk9ud0EyZkh4NTR0X0RPTTQ5cGh1bUdZNWpFM1BjcEFQdXhVNHlvZmZ1ZTYwLURpUHVET0RJLUgwN1JiVGpQNUtoaER0empTSmcyNFdDR20yd01OaGxiVXNHeEh6TVBhUXBLVF84alBBNzVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Whistler Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quo